    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STUMP is a <strong>moving</strong> <strong>Tower Defense</strong> game. Cross the maze while facing waves of <strong>creatures</strong> determined to devour you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715310/extras/e3da73ee7cd19cd2cda335a4b7c70465.avif?t=1754037457\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Stump</strong>, protecting <strong>Lucile</strong>: a strange creature determined to bind her fate to yours. You share your health points and advance together, room by room, fighting the creatures along your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715310/extras/0e7436fb40fa903579e20c3f881fc818.avif?t=1754037457\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you, you are accompanied by <strong>war sticks</strong> that must be placed strategically during battles. Upgrade them and learn their synergies to carve a path through this ruined realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715310/extras/615651b8c0484b76b293152d63ef2215.avif?t=1754037457\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping this labyrinth will not be easy.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STUMP is a <strong>moving</strong> <strong>Tower Defense</strong> game. Cross the maze while facing waves of <strong>creatures</strong> determined to devour you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715310/extras/e3da73ee7cd19cd2cda335a4b7c70465.avif?t=1754037457\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Stump</strong>, protecting <strong>Lucile</strong>: a strange creature determined to bind her fate to yours. You share your health points and advance together, room by room, fighting the creatures along your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715310/extras/0e7436fb40fa903579e20c3f881fc818.avif?t=1754037457\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you, you are accompanied by <strong>war sticks</strong> that must be placed strategically during battles. Upgrade them and learn their synergies to carve a path through this ruined realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715310/extras/615651b8c0484b76b293152d63ef2215.avif?t=1754037457\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping this labyrinth will not be easy.</p>",
    "short_description": "Sticks in hand, you journey through the labyrinth. Stump is a moving, chaotic, and mystical tower-defense experience.",
